        "Operation: x @ weight.T + bias."
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_004",
      "source": "x = self.norm(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "BatchNorm1d in inference mode: normalize using running_mean and running_var, then affine transform with weight and bias.",
        "Input [256, 8192] -> output [256, 8192].",
        "Eps = 1e-05, momentum = 0.1 (momentum only affects training, but included for API compatibility)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_005",
